# The loading bar at the top middle of the window (LoadingIndicator): a pulsing pill while the server
# hasn't answered, in the 10 pt margin above the card. Maximized with the sidebar hidden the card goes
# edge to edge and there is no margin: the bar sat in none and every load went unseen (10 Nov 2026).
# It now lies just inside the page's top edge. ${STALL} accepts connections and never answers.
cra://debug?windowSize=1000x700
wait 2
cra://open?url=${STALL}/
wait 1.5
cra://debug?windowState=inset
# Centred over the card (x 328 + 662/2 - 66), in the margin above it (700 - 10).
expect-log window state inset: main0 .*card=328,10,.* loading=waiting,1,\d+,690
cra://debug?zoomWindow=1
wait 1.5
cra://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1.5
cra://debug?windowState=edge
expect-log window state edge: main0 .*card=0,0,.* docked=0 .*loading=waiting,1,\d+,\d+
reject-log window state edge: .*loading=waiting,0
cra://action/stop
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=stopped
expect-log window state stopped: main0 .*loading=hidden,1,
cra://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1
cra://debug?zoomWindow=1
wait 1.5
